+++
name = "Tagged notes"
+++
-- A lens is a saved query the graph wears (`:lens Tagged notes`): its **note column** is
-- the whole answer, and the picture keeps exactly those notes. Everything else the query
-- selects is decoration, and the order is the answer's own.
--
-- This one keeps the three notes that write a tag — the tour, the welcome page, and the
-- test note — and drops the note that writes none.
SELECT DISTINCT note FROM props WHERE key = 'tags' ORDER BY note
